{"id":"00314","root":"uni00314_1","name":{"ja":"心願寺　紅","en":"Shinganji Kurenai"},"title":{"ja":"【春の旋風】","en":"【Spring Whirlwind】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【春の旋風】 心願寺　紅","en":"【Spring Whirlwind】 Shinganji Kurenai"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-03-31","limited":true,"characterId":6,"profile":{"ja":"吸血鬼と人間のハーフでありながら対魔忍として生きる異端の存在。祖父である“ふうま八将”心願寺幻庵から剣術の指南を受け、ゆくゆくは八将を継ぐと目されていた実力者。しかし、かつての内紛でふうま宗家に助力した咎で幻庵は失脚。その跡目を継ぐはずだった紅もふうまの里を離れ、現在はどこにも属さない自由な立場で行動している。元ふうま八将という出自から、宗家の跡取りであるふうま小太郎とも旧知の間柄。とある誓約によって五車に立ち入ることは許されない立場だったが……。","en":"(Shinganji Kurenai, she/her) She is a half-vampire, half-human who lives as an outlier Taimanin. Her grandfather, the Fuuma \"Eight Generals\" Shinganji Gen-an, taught her swordsmanship, and she was once expected to inherit the Eight Generals' mantle. However, after assisting the Fuuma main family during a past internal conflict, Gen-an fell from grace, and the heir-apparent Kurenai left the Fuuma village. Now she acts independently, belonging to no faction. Because of her former status as a Fuuma Eight General, she is also an old acquaintance of Fuuma Kotaro, the heir of the Fuuma house. A certain oath once barred her from entering Gosha, but…"},"illustrator":"ZOL","voiceActor":"かざりゆえ","forms":[{"id":"uni00314_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1048,2096],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[147,294],"def":[104,208],"spd":[85,85],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["2","530001"],"evolve":[["evo00004",5],["evo00005",15],["evo00006",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00314_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1596,3192],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[229,458],"def":[143,286],"spd":[85,85],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["2","530001","530002"],"evolve":[["evo00005",10],["evo00006",15],["evo00016",4],["evo00017",2]]},{"id":"uni00314_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2144,4296],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[316,633],"def":[187